WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.377 --> 00:00:03.710
Unit fifteen. Places in Town!

2
00:00:04.685 --> 00:00:12.923
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Chanthy. Welcome to C2-EPE Master English, Beginner level!

3
00:00:12.973 --> 00:00:17.461
Hi, Teacher Chanthy! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:17.511 --> 00:00:21.668
Today we learn: Places in Town. Let's go!

5
00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:26.240
Market. Say it with me. Market!

6
00:00:29.765 --> 00:00:33.398
School. Say it with me. School!

7
00:00:36.899 --> 00:00:40.532
Hospital. Say it with me. Hospital!

8
00:00:44.033 --> 00:00:47.400
Park. Say it with me. Park!

9
00:00:50.901 --> 00:00:54.451
Bank. Say it with me. Bank!

10
00:00:57.986 --> 00:01:01.870
Library. Say it with me. Library!

11
00:01:05.318 --> 00:01:08.868
Shop. Say it with me. Shop!

12
00:01:12.369 --> 00:01:16.186
Street. Say it with me. Street!

13
00:01:19.689 --> 00:01:23.273
Corner. Say it with me. Corner!

14
00:01:26.792 --> 00:01:30.442
Visit. Say it with me. Visit!

15
00:01:33.922 --> 00:01:43.339
Grammar time! There is / are + place. Listen. There is a market. There are two shops.

16
00:01:43.389 --> 00:01:49.112
Your turn. Say it with me. There is a market. There are two shops.

17
00:01:54.254 --> 00:02:01.503
The market is on the same street as the bank and the library. My school is near the park and the hospital.

18
00:02:01.553 --> 00:02:03.018
I like this story!

19
00:02:04.006 --> 00:02:09.246
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:09.296 --> 00:02:10.446
Hospital!

21
00:02:11.576 --> 00:02:16.851
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:16.901 --> 00:02:18.051
Shop!

23
00:02:18.891 --> 00:02:26.830
Think and answer. What places are near your home?

24
00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:28.076
Great answer!

25
00:02:29.155 --> 00:02:33.459
Great work today! See you next time. Goodbye!

26
00:02:33.509 --> 00:02:35.101
Goodbye, everyone!

